  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 5.94,
      "e": 8.78,
      "text": "So our unit's role is basically to support the community."
    },
    {
      "s": 8.78,
      "e": 13.1,
      "text": "The community called upon us to come help support in the fire breaks or whatever we can."
    },
    {
      "s": 13.1,
      "e": 14.46,
      "text": "We're not the leaders of this mission."
    },
    {
      "s": 14.46,
      "e": 15.98,
      "text": "We're here to support the community."
    },
    {
      "s": 15.98,
      "e": 20.46,
      "text": "So the support mission we got came down from hire to come out and provide fire breaks."
    },
    {
      "s": 20.46,
      "e": 23.46,
      "text": "So my company is a horizontal company."
    },
    {
      "s": 23.46,
      "e": 29.66,
      "text": "So we brought out 4D7s which is a big heavy dozer capability of pushing thousands of pounds"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.66,
      "e": 33.3,
      "text": "of dirt at a quick pace."
    },
    {
      "s": 33.3,
      "e": 36.9,
      "text": "So we got out on ground and we immediately linked up with the 4 Carson Fire Chief which"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.9,
      "e": 40.38,
      "text": "is Captain Montoya and then he began putting us to work."
    },
    {
      "s": 40.38,
      "e": 44.3,
      "text": "Yesterday we got here, started building in fire breaks and trying to stop the fire from"
    },
    {
      "s": 44.3,
      "e": 46.74,
      "text": "pressing north."
    },
    {
      "s": 46.74,
      "e": 51.3,
      "text": "Seast that activity yesterday about 1800 came back out here this morning about 6 and now"
    },
    {
      "s": 51.3,
      "e": 56.3,
      "text": "we're starting to push more north and remove brush piles and the wood chips that easily"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.3,
      "e": 61.38,
      "text": "ignites to stop the fire from pressing north even further."
    },
    {
      "s": 61.38,
      "e": 63.66,
      "text": "Yesterday it was real windy."
    },
    {
      "s": 63.66,
      "e": 67.94,
      "text": "We went in, we did a couple miles and then as soon as we pushed north the wind caught us"
    },
    {
      "s": 67.94,
      "e": 69.94,
      "text": "and the fire got bigger so we had to get out of there."
    },
    {
      "s": 69.94,
      "e": 73.78,
      "text": "Today the wind seems calmer and we seem to be making more progress stopping the fires"
    },
    {
      "s": 73.78,
      "e": 75.26,
      "text": "that before it advances too far."
    }
  ],
